  " EC Protection Floor": " EC 保护下限",
  " — reads the ALS directly. One-Euro-filtered lux signal, log lux → brightness curve, sustained-change requirement before reacting (won't twitch on transient flashes), direction-aware response (brightens quickly when entering a darker space, dims slowly to avoid flicker), smooth eased transitions instead of stepped jumps, lux-ratio override hold (your manual adjustment sticks until ambient changes by 2×). Each time you nudge the slider, the helper learns your preferred offset for that ambient range (six log-spaced lux buckets) and biases future predictions toward what you picked. Switching to Helper turns Windows ADAPTBRIGHT off so the two don't fight.": " — reads the ALS directly. One-Euro-filtered lux signal, log lux → brightness curve, sustained-change requirement before reacting (won't twitch on transient flashes), direction-aware response (brightens quickly when entering a darker space, dims slowly to avoid flicker), smooth eased transitions instead of stepped jumps, lux-ratio override hold (your manual adjustment sticks until ambient changes by 2×). Each time you nudge the slider, the helper learns your preferred offset for that ambient range (six log-spaced lux buckets) and biases future predictions toward what you picked. Switching to Helper turns Windows ADAPTBRIGHT off so the two don't fight.",
