  "xBR": "xBR",
  "• Curves & unlock state save per power mode\n• Dropdown selects which mode to edit, not the active one\n• Unlock OFF: firmware drives the fan (Custom only via WMI, with firmware-enforced floors)\n• Unlock ON: helper writes the curve directly to EC every 3s, in any mode\n• Axis labels (10°C–100°C) are how the curve is stored; firmware modes may map temps differently": "• 曲线与解锁状态按电源模式分别保存\n• 下拉框选择要编辑的模式，不会切换当前模式\n• 关闭解锁：由固件控制风扇，仅自定义模式可通过 WMI 设置，受固件下限约束\n• 开启解锁：助手在任意模式下每 3 秒直接将曲线写入 EC\n• 10°C–100°C 为曲线存储坐标；不同固件模式的温度映射可能不同",
  "• Never 0% above ~50°C\n• 101°C software failsafe forces max RPM": "• 温度约高于 50°C 时不得设为 0%\n• 101°C 软件保护会强制最高转速",
  "⚠ Helper disconnected with EC override active. Fan may be stuck at the last RPM until the helper reconnects, or reboot to clear.": "⚠ EC 覆盖启用时助手连接已断开。风扇可能维持最后转速，直到助手重新连接；也可重启恢复。",
  "⚠ Use Hibernate instead of Sleep": "⚠ 建议使用休眠代替睡眠",
