  "Credits:": "致谢：",
  "Microsoft Default Game Profiles provide optimized TDP and FPS settings for specific games. When this is off, GoTweaks will not apply Default Game Profiles at all. It is on by default on devices with native profile support (Legion Go Z1/Z2 Extreme); on other AMD devices, turning it on uses Z1 Extreme (OMNI) profiles as a fallback.": "Microsoft 默认游戏配置为特定游戏提供优化的 TDP 与 FPS 设置。关闭后 LegionGoBar 不会应用这些配置。原生支持配置的 Legion Go Z1 / Z2 Extreme 默认开启；其他 AMD 设备开启后会使用 Z1 Extreme（OMNI）配置作为兼容方案。",
  "e.g. C:\\\\path\\\\app.exe -arg1": "例如 C:\\\\path\\\\app.exe -arg1",
  "⚠ Aggressive curves can damage hardware": "⚠ 激进的风扇曲线可能损坏硬件",
  "Windows — uses the OS adaptive brightness service (ADAPTBRIGHT). Slow, opaque, single hard-coded curve, no learning.Helper (learns) — reads the ALS directly. One-Euro-filtered lux signal, log lux → brightness curve, sustained-change requirement before reacting (won't twitch on transient flashes), direction-aware response (brightens quickly when entering a darker space, dims slowly to avoid flicker), smooth eased transitions instead of stepped jumps, lux-ratio override hold (your manual adjustment sticks until ambient changes by 2×). Each time you nudge the slider, the helper learns your preferred offset for that ambient range (six log-spaced lux buckets) and biases future predictions toward what you picked. Switching to Helper turns Windows ADAPTBRIGHT off so the two don't fight.": "Windows：使用系统自适应亮度服务 ADAPTBRIGHT，响应较慢，采用固定曲线，不学习偏好。\n助手：直接读取环境光传感器 ALS，以 One Euro 滤波和对数亮度曲线处理持续变化，忽略短暂闪光；按方向调整响应速度，并平滑过渡。手动亮度会保持到环境光改变约 2 倍。每次手动调整都会更新对应环境范围的偏好；切换到助手时会关闭 Windows ADAPTBRIGHT，避免冲突。",
